<title>USA: Group holds 6.6 pct Consolidated Cigar stake.</title>
<headline>Group holds 6.6 pct Consolidated Cigar stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by BKP Partners L.P., a California limited partnership, said Thursday it holds a 6.6 percent stake in Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc or 403,900 Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between August 16 and September 3 at prices ranging from $23 and $31.75 per share.</p>
<p>The group bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
